repository-code: https://github.com/gufranco/dungeon-master-nochip
url: https://github.com/gufranco/dungeon-master-nochip
abstract: >-
  Removes the DSP-2 from Dungeon Master for the Super Nintendo by replacing what
  the coprocessor computed with 65816 routines that run on the console itself.
  The retail cartridge is the only authority on what the game asks, and the
  part's own microcode is the only authority on what the answer is: every
  routine is checked byte for byte against recorded traffic replayed through the
  real program.
keywords:
  - super-nintendo
  - dungeon-master
  - dsp2
  - rom-hacking
  - 65816
  - conformance
